      {"id":"appE0051","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p style=\"font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #666; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">CNC engraving is a versatile process with applications across industries and project types. Common uses include:</p>","align":"left"},"elements":[]},
      {"id":"appE006","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<ul style=\"list-style:none; padding:0; columns:1; column-gap:30px;\">\n<li style=\"font-family:'Lora',serif; font-size:0.95rem; color:#666; line-height:1.7; padding:8px 0 8px 22px; position:relative;\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:16px;width:8px;height:8px;background:#1380da;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;\"></span><strong style=\"color:#03325e;\">Custom nameplates and ID tags</strong> &mdash; durable, legible identification for equipment, personnel, and facilities</li>\n<li style=\"font-family:'Lora',serif; font-size:0.95rem; color:#666; line-height:1.7; padding:8px 0 8px 22px; position:relative;\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:16px;width:8px;height:8px;background:#1380da;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;\"></span><strong style=\"color:#03325e;\">Engraved logos and branding</strong> &mdash; precise reproduction of company marks on display panels, signage, and products</li>\n<li style=\"font-family:'Lora',serif; font-size:0.95rem; color:#666; line-height:1.7; padding:8px 0 8px 22px; position:relative;\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:16px;width:8px;height:8px;background:#1380da;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;\"></span><strong style=\"color:#03325e;\">Business and industrial signage</strong> &mdash; professional-grade signs for offices, facilities, and manufacturing environments</li>\n<li style=\"font-family:'Lora',serif; font-size:0.95rem; color:#666; line-height:1.7; padding:8px 0 8px 22px; position:relative;\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:16px;width:8px;height:8px;background:#1380da;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;\"></span><strong style=\"color:#03325e;\">Decorative panels and artistic surfaces</strong> &mdash; detailed patterns and designs for retail, hospitality, and architectural applications</li>\n<li style=\"font-family:'Lora',serif; font-size:0.95rem; color:#666; line-height:1.7; padding:8px 0 8px 22px; position:relative;\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:16px;width:8px;height:8px;background:#1380da;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;\"></span><strong style=\"color:#03325e;\">Engraving stock for further processing</strong> &mdash; pre-engraved material for downstream fabrication or assembly</li>\n</ul>","align":"left"},"elements":[]}
    ],"isInner":true}
  ],"isInner":false},

