      {"id":"mac005","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p style=\"font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 0.92rem; color: #4A5568; line-height: 1.7;\">Our CNC engraving machine handles sheet sizes up to 38\" &times; 72\", making it one of the more capable setups for large-format plastic engraving in the region. Whether you&rsquo;re producing a single custom piece or a bulk order of identical components, our machine delivers consistent precision from the first part to the last.</p><p style=\"font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 0.92rem; color: #4A5568; line-height: 1.7; margin-top: 12px; font-weight: 600;\">Key capabilities include:</p><ul style=\"list-style:none; padding:0; margin-top:8px;\">\n<li style=\"font-family:'Lora',serif; font-size:0.88rem; color:#666; line-height:1.7; padding:4px 0 4px 18px; position:relative;\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:12px;width:6px;height:6px;background:#1380da;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;\"></span>Acrylic and polycarbonate engraving</li>\n<li style=\"font-family:'Lora',serif; font-size:0.88rem; color:#666; line-height:1.7; padding:4px 0 4px 18px; position:relative;\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:12px;width:6px;height:6px;background:#1380da;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;\"></span>Custom designs including logos, text, and detailed artwork</li>\n<li style=\"font-family:'Lora',serif; font-size:0.88rem; color:#666; line-height:1.7; padding:4px 0 4px 18px; position:relative;\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:12px;width:6px;height:6px;background:#1380da;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;\"></span>High-precision etching for fine or intricate work</li>\n<li style=\"font-family:'Lora',serif; font-size:0.88rem; color:#666; line-height:1.7; padding:4px 0 4px 18px; position:relative;\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:12px;width:6px;height:6px;background:#1380da;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;\"></span>Large-format engraving up to 38\" &times; 72\"</li>\n<li style=\"font-family:'Lora',serif; font-size:0.88rem; color:#666; line-height:1.7; padding:4px 0 4px 18px; position:relative;\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:12px;width:6px;height:6px;background:#1380da;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;\"></span>Support for large-scale, bulk, and repeat orders</li>\n</ul>","align":"left"},"elements":[]}
    ],"isInner":true}
