  {"id":"proc001","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"50","right":"0","bottom":"50","left":"0","isLinked":false},"background_background":"classic","background_color":"#FFFFFF"},"elements":[
    {"id":"proc002","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"Our CNC Engraving Process","header_size":"h2","align":"center","title_color":"#03325e","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Playfair Display","typography_font_size":{"unit":"rem","size":1.8},"typography_font_weight":"700","_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"8","left":"0","isLinked":false}},"elements":[]},
    {"id":"proc0021","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p style=\"font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #666; text-align: center;\">We keep our process straightforward so you always know where your project stands.</p>","align":"center","_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"28","left":"0","isLinked":false}},"elements":[]},
    {"id":"proc003","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<div class=\"process-track-wrapper\">\n  <div class=\"process-track\" id=\"processTrack\">\n\n    <div class=\"process-card\">\n      <div class=\"step-num\">1</div>\n      <h4>Design Submission</h4>\n      <p>Submit your existing design file, or work with our team to develop one. We accept common formats and can advise on how to prepare artwork for the best engraving results.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"process-card\">\n      <div class=\"step-num\">2</div>\n      <h4>Material Selection</h4>\n      <p>Choose the right plastic for your application &mdash; acrylic, polycarbonate, or another suitable option. Not sure what to specify? We&rsquo;ll help you select the material that best fits your performance, aesthetic, and budget requirements.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"process-card\">\n      <div class=\"step-num\">3</div>\n      <h4>Precision Engraving</h4>\n      <p>Our CNC machine executes your design with computer-controlled accuracy, carving every detail cleanly into the surface of your chosen material.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"process-card\">\n      <div class=\"step-num\">4</div>\n      <h4>Quality Inspection</h4>\n      <p>Every finished piece is reviewed against your specifications before it leaves our floor. Dimensions, detail, and surface quality are all verified to make sure the final product meets your standards.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"process-card\">\n      <div class=\"step-num\">5</div>\n      <h4>Packaging &amp; Delivery</h4>\n      <p>Your order is carefully packaged and shipped according to your requirements &mdash; whether that&rsquo;s a single custom panel or a bulk production run.</p>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"process-dots\" id=\"processDots\"></div>"},"elements":[]}
  ],"isInner":false},

  {"id":"faq001","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"boxed","boxed_width":{"unit":"px","size":800},"flex_direction":"column","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"56","right":"40","bottom":"56","left":"40","isLinked":false},"background_background":"classic","background_color":"#F8FAFC","border_border":"solid","border_width":{"unit":"px","top":"1","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"border_color":"#E2E8F0"},"elements":[
    {"id":"faq002","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"Frequently Asked Questions About CNC Engraving","header_size":"h2","align":"center","title_color":"#03325e","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Playfair Display","typography_font_size":{"unit":"rem","size":1.8},"typography_font_weight":"700","_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"30","left":"0","isLinked":false}},"elements":[]},
    {"id":"faq003","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<div id=\"faqList\">\n\n  <div class=\"faq-item\">\n    <div class=\"faq-q\">What materials can be CNC engraved?</div>\n    <div class=\"faq-a\"><p>CNC engraving works well on a wide range of plastic materials, including acrylic (PMMA), polycarbonate (PC), PVC, PETG, and other rigid thermoplastics. At Plastic-Craft, we primarily engrave acrylic and polycarbonate sheets, which offer excellent surface clarity and hold fine detail exceptionally well.</p></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"faq-item\">\n    <div class=\"faq-q\">What is the maximum size for CNC engraving at Plastic-Craft?</div>\n    <div class=\"faq-a\"><p>Our CNC engraving machine accommodates plastic sheets up to 38\" &times; 72\", making it suitable for both standard and oversized applications such as large signage, display panels, and architectural elements.</p></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"faq-item\">\n    <div class=\"faq-q\">What file formats do you accept for CNC engraving?</div>\n    <div class=\"faq-a\"><p>We recommend submitting vector files for the sharpest results. If you don&rsquo;t have a ready-to-use file, our team can work with you to prepare one. Contact us to discuss your specific design format.</p></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"faq-item\">\n    <div class=\"faq-q\">What&rsquo;s the difference between CNC engraving and laser engraving?</div>\n    <div class=\"faq-a\"><p>CNC engraving uses a physical rotating cutting tool to mechanically remove material from the surface, producing deep, tactile engravings with clean edges. Laser engraving uses a focused beam of light to burn or vaporize the surface. Both are effective for plastics, but CNC engraving is often preferred when depth, durability, and crisp line definition are priorities.</p></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"faq-item\">\n    <div class=\"faq-q\">Can Plastic-Craft handle bulk or repeat CNC engraving orders?</div>\n    <div class=\"faq-a\"><p>Yes. Our machine is well-suited for high-volume and repeat production runs. Once your design file is set up, we can reproduce it consistently across large quantities with minimal variance.</p></div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>"},"elements":[]}
  ],"isInner":false},

